&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: left"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedConsolidatedDetailedScheduleOfCorporateBondsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AnnexedConsolidatedDetailedScheduleOfBorrowingsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;【借入金等明細表】&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 648px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 258px"/&gt;
